request.description:
Create environment config for an API.

Credentials format by auth type:
- BEARER: {"token": "xxx"}
- API_KEY: {"headerName": "X-API-Key", "apiKey": "xxx"}
- BASIC: {"username": "xxx", "password": "xxx"}
- OAUTH2: {"accessToken": "xxx"}
- CUSTOM: {"Header1": "value1", "Header2": "value2"}

Environment: DEV or PROD

Execute an API that has path parameters.

TAHAQUQ_VERIFY_MOBILE endpoint: /api/v1/person/{nid}/owns-mobile/{mobile}

The pathParams map replaces {nid} and {mobile} in the URL.
